@startuml
title UML - native periodic basis capture, replay and audit recovery
actor "Finance maker" as Maker
boundary "Workforce API / policy screen" as API
control "Finance basis orchestration" as Finance
control "Core BasisRecords" as Core
database "PostgreSQL guarded native capture" as DB
control "Bank worker audit recovery" as Worker
participant "Controls audit" as Audit
Maker -> API : Account + exact published policy + period start\nOriginal actor/client/key; no supplied balance/clock
API -> Finance : Authenticate workforce + Origin / CSRF
Finance -> Core : Current maker / REVIEW; capture original scope
Core -> DB : Acquire actor-key lock
DB -> DB : Recheck live canonical person / grants / queue after wait
alt Exact key already captured
 DB --> Core : Original artifact / clock / native source membership
else New observation
 DB -> DB : Exact policy product binding and finite UTC calendar
 DB -> DB : One statement MVCC snapshot of account metadata\nand committed native business-date journal prefix
 DB -> DB : Limit 1001 candidates; reject above 1000\nExact i128 opening + change = closing
 DB -> DB : Atomic immutable native artifact + source digests
 DB --> Core : Original native capture UUID
end
Core -> DB : Read saved artifact + exact saved native journal facts
Core -> Core : Verify raw/typed hashes, metadata, scope and totals\nCross-check native IDs / fingerprints / deltas
Core -> Core : Preview using saved native clock and basis\nSuppress ineligible basis; no financial command
Core --> Finance : Verified native detail / sources
Finance -> DB : Stable audit_pending ID = basis UUID\nOriginal canonical person / capture time
Finance --> API : Immutable observation + optional calculation
API --> Maker : Saved URL; separate current vs historical position\nOpen provisional / closed observation; paged native sources
Worker -> Core : Next 50 basis UUIDs after persisted cursor
Core --> Worker : Verify original saved artifacts
Worker -> DB : Idempotently repair missing original audit\nAdvance past failures; wrap for retry
Worker -> Audit : Existing audit relay
note over Maker,DB
No enrollment, financial posting, hold mutation or amount owed.
Closed period is not a global book close; late facts need a fresh key.
Replay never refreshes a saved observation.
end note
@enduml
